cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: iEEG HFO
abstract: 'Detects high-frequency oscillations (ripples and fast ripples) on every good channel of intracranial EEG with epycom''s line-length, RMS or CS detector and writes the events and rates per channel; recordings sampled below 1000 Hz are skipped by design.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-ieeg-hfo
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- ieeg
- seeg
- ecog
- electrophysiology
- epilepsy
- neuroscience
- hfo
- event-detection
